# Till Death Do Us Part (bastok 18): Romilda in Port Bastok. The guard (Forever to Hold completed), the fame side inside
# the trigger (127 below fame level 3, the offer 128 at 3), the Cotton Gloves trade, the 2000 gil reward. Romilda's
# default is 34; Forever to Hold also names her (a hairpin trade while it is accepted), and this char never accepts it.
lists PortBastok/Romilda/onTrigger PortBastok/Romilda/onTrade PortBastok/onEventFinish/128 PortBastok/onEventFinish/129
char zone=PortBastok pos=5.4,4.898,-17.7
fame Bastok 124
item CottonGloves
item CottonGloves
item BoneChip
login
trade Romilda CottonGloves x1   # available, Forever to Hold not completed: no trade handler, nothing
trigger Romilda                 # Forever to Hold not completed: her default 34
finish
quest Bastok.ForeverToHold completed
trigger Romilda                 # Forever to Hold completed, fame 124 (level 2): 127
finish
trade Romilda CottonGloves x1   # available, the guard met: no trade handler in section 1, nothing
fame Bastok 125
trigger Romilda                 # fame level 3: the offer, 128
finish                          # accepted
trigger Romilda                 # accepted: no trigger in section 2, her default 34
finish
trade Romilda BoneChip x1       # the wrong item: nothing
trade Romilda CottonGloves x1   # 129
finish                          # completed: 2000 gil, fame +30, Qiji's Rival, the gloves gone
trigger Romilda                 # completed: 34
finish
trade Romilda CottonGloves x1   # completed: nothing
